{% endif -%}
Helix editor themes for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

{% if adapter.mirror -%}
Clone the repository and symlink or copy the theme files:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/{{ adapter.mirror }}.git
cp {{ repo }}/*.toml ~/.config/helix/themes/
```
{% else -%}
Symlink or copy the theme files:

```bash
cp *.toml ~/.config/helix/themes/
```
{% endif %}
Then add to your Helix config (`~/.config/helix/config.toml`):

```toml
theme = "{{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}"
```
{% for v in variants | slice(start=1) %}
Or for {{ v.variant.id }}:

```toml
theme = "{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}"
```
{% endfor %}
## Variants

{% for v in variants -%}
- **{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}** - {{ v.variant.description }}
{% endfor -%}
